d77-a02ce8fbcdae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"像对手学习而不是像朋友学习，因为朋友都是和我们相似的人。对手不是敌对的人，而是有着不同观点、不同做事背景、不同经验的人，这样可以获得新的视角和方法，打破思维定式"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3ebe85e6-5d99-45a5-aa4a-3d5b4e1720ba","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"80d06672-9cfa-4cc6-bb5f-61eed495b72d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要充分给出组织/上级给你分配资源的理由。在日常工作中适当的展示自己的能力，为他人解决问题来证明自己对团队的价值，"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"7cfabedd-ee4d-49ca-8f99-b362038589af","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最令人满足的不是得到了好绩效，而是其他人都认为应该获得好绩效"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"04b46d26-df62-4040-9566-a10f5b9d4d58","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b16247ca-135a-4761-8de6-57297c96417c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对己"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"178d1955-d1fc-4225-ae78-da5f33bd1b46","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0c6cd6d1-6b18-4959-b384-c497ee7b203c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a070f3c-87b0-4d02-85e6-d4092f011c57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先斩后奏。在不过分超出能力的情况下，先做出承诺，再逼自己改进这件事情。"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"即使一开始感到不安，也不要轻易拒绝新的机会"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368